            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:50:11.281744+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b10",
            "text": "Yes, I have a mutation of thrushes eating me out of bird food.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:50:11.281744+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b10-semeval-9323",
            "_key": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b10-semeval-9323",
            "chunk_id": "semeval-9323",
            "construction_schema": "occurrence-v1",
            "content_hash": "sha256:9223fd53d396f1a967221fe8a93f6add51d571629fdf74e0412ebe402a67b70f",
            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:50:11.281749+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r2-b10",
            "text": "The only light was from two turrets of bulletproof glass.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:50:11.281749+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r2-b10-semeval-9367",
